task: "ara (u21) and edward (u22) on 100.64.0.14: SSE/channel messages keep showing up in the Codex chat area; ciel records them prompt_not_submitted. User: 'SSE 이벤트를 제대로 주입을 못해주는 CIEL-RUNTIME의 문제', and asked for block delivery instead of typing in Codex."
